1
00:00:00,398 --> 00:00:01,848
(Howard:)Is this getting weird?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
(Raj:)Hang on.

3
00:00:07,505 --> 00:00:09,175
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes.

4
00:00:11,342 --> 00:00:13,452
(Ira:)Hey.

5
00:00:13,678 --> 00:00:15,918
(Leonard:)I just wanted to let you know
that I posted my findings.

6
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,150
(Sheldon:)I saw.

7
00:00:17,315 --> 00:00:20,595
(Sheldon:)And I just posted
a retraction of my paper.

8
00:00:20,752 --> 00:00:23,592
(Sheldon:)Now the whole scientific community
knows I was wrong.

9
00:00:23,755 --> 00:00:26,255
(Leonard:)These things happen
all the time, Sheldon.

10
00:00:26,424 --> 00:00:27,424
(Sheldon:)Not to me.

11
00:00:27,592 --> 00:00:29,542
(Sheldon:)The only other retraction
I ever had to issue

12
00:00:29,694 --> 00:00:32,194
(Sheldon:)was when I was seven
and I conceded that my brother

13
00:00:32,363 --> 00:00:34,703
(Sheldon:)was the greatest ninja
in East Texas.

14
00:00:36,334 --> 00:00:38,974
(Sheldon:)But that was just a ploy
to get my face out of his armpit.

15
00:00:40,438 --> 00:00:42,218
There he is!

16
00:00:43,374 --> 00:00:44,824
It's my favourite superhero,

17
00:00:44,976 --> 00:00:46,886
the Retractorl

18
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,380
(Bernadette:)Come on,
don't give him a hard time.

19
00:00:51,549 --> 00:00:52,689
I'm sorry, Cooper.

20
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,390
I retract it.

21
00:00:55,987 --> 00:00:57,657
(Barry:)By the way, Hofstadter,

22
00:00:57,822 --> 00:01:00,202
nice job disproving
the Chinese team.

